\"SimHei\",sans-serif;\n    margin:6px 0;\n  }\n\n  .big-banner {\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:34px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    letter-spacing:2px;\n    font-family:\"Heiti SC\",\"SimHei\",sans-serif;\n    margin:10px 0 4px;\n  }\n  .banner-sub { text-align:center; font-size:12px; margin-bottom:4px; }\n\n  .brief-title {\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-family:\"Heiti SC\",\"SimHei\",sans-serif;\n    margin:6px 0 4px;\n  }\n  .brief-title.small { font-size:19px; }\n  .datel { text-indent:0; }\n  .divider { border-top:1px solid #000; margin:8px 0; }\n  .thin-divider { border-top:1px solid #999; margin:6px 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- ================= MASTHEAD ================= -->\n  <div class=\"masthead\">\n    <div class=\"masthead-left\">\n      <div class=\"section-name\">要闻</div>\n      <div class=\"page-no\">2</div>\n      <div class=\"issue-date\">2025年1月8日 星期三</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"logo\">人民日报</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= TOP HALF ================= -->\n  <div class=\"cols\">\n\n    <!-- ---------- LEFT: 促进政府投资基金高质量发展 ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"flex:0 0 400px;\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">国办印发指导意见</div>\n      <h1 class=\"headline\">促进政府投资基金高质量发展</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"datel illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <h2 class=\"sub\" style=\"font-size:19px;\">全国统一大市场<br>重点工作深入推进</h2>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <h3 class=\"mid\">提高方向性、框架性<br>指导和阶段性工作要求</h3>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- MIDDLE: 权威发布 ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"flex:0 0 150px;\">\n      <p class=\"tagline\"><span class=\"tag\">R</span>权威发布</p>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sub\">最大限度减少入企检查频次</h2>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sub\">不得实施未经公布的行政检查事项</h2>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- RIGHT: vertical headline ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"flex:0 0 90px;\">\n      <div class=\"vertical-zone\">\n        <div class=\"v-main\">从源头上遏制乱检查</div>\n        <div class=\"v-sub\">十项措施着力解决涉企行政检查中突出问题</div>\n        <div class=\"v-byline\">本报记者　张　璁</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- FAR RIGHT column ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"flex:0 0 130px;\">\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sub\">明确“谁能检查、谁不能检查”</h2>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n      <p style=\"text-indent:0; text-align:right;\">［相关报道见第十版］</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n  <!-- ================= MIDDLE BANNER ================= -->\n  <div class=\"cols\">\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"flex:0 0 400px;\">\n      <div class=\"big-banner\">全国统一大市场建设指引实施</div>\n      <div class=\"banner-sub\">从“要求做的”“禁止做的”“鼓励做的”3个维度提出要求和目标</div>\n      <div class=\"byline\">本报记者　刘志强</div>\n\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <h3 class=\"mid\">将以更有力有效、可<br>感可及举措推动落实</h3>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"tagline\"><span class=\"tag\">R</span>政策解读</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n          <p class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- PHOTO ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%; height:330px;\">\n        [Photo: 挖掘机在稻草堆场作业，占据版面右侧中部]\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"photo-caption\">1月7日，河北省唐山市曹妃甸区某人农场稻草回收企业工人操作机械对稻草进行打包作业。曹妃甸区积极推动稻草回收再利用，将稻草用于饲料、食用菌种植、造纸等领域，实现绿色循环发展。<br>新华社记者　杨世尧摄</p>\n      <div class=\"photo-title\">稻草回收变废为宝</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n  <!-- ================= BOTTOM ================= -->\n  <div class=\"cols\">\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"flex:0 0 400px;\">\n      <div class=\"brief-title\">2024年国内发明专利有效量达 475.6 万件</div>\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <p class=\"datel\">本报北京